---
// Chapter 2 — the stranger recognizes the pain.
// Not a CI thesis. Two facts that cannot both be fine.
---

<section id="gap" class="px-10 pb-[88px] pt-2 max-md:px-5 max-md:pb-16">
  <div class="container-site">
    <div class="mb-12 flex max-w-[640px] flex-col gap-3.5">
      <span class="eyebrow">The gap</span>
      <h2 class="m-0 text-[40px] font-semibold leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.025em] [text-wrap:balance] max-md:text-[32px]">
        A 200 is not a working checkout.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-10 max-md:grid-cols-1 max-md:gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-line pt-7">
        <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-green">14:02 · uptime</span>
        <span
          class="text-[88px] font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.055em] text-ink max-md:text-[64px]"
          >200</span
        >
        <p class="m-0 max-w-[360px] text-[16px] leading-[1.5] text-body [text-wrap:pretty]">
          Every request healthy. The merge was green. Everyone went home.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-t border-line pt-7">
        <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-red">03:14 · production</span>
        <span
          class="text-[88px] font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.055em] text-red max-md:text-[64px]"
          >0,00 €</span
        >
        <p class="m-0 max-w-[360px] text-[16px] leading-[1.5] text-body [text-wrap:pretty]">
          A third-party price feed goes quiet. The total is zero, with a 200 on every request.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="m-0 mt-12 max-w-[640px] text-[18px] leading-[1.5] text-ink [text-wrap:pretty] max-md:text-[16px]">
      09:40 a customer emails. Thirteen hours later.{' '}
      <span class="text-violet">Or 03:21, if something walked the flow and told you.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
